00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:50,160
us was getting hammered with 10,000 emails all coming from Peter Weiner when the pen test was on.

118
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:56,160
Some people started to complain. And initially, we thought they're just being silly. You know,

119
00:12:56,160 --> 00:13:02,160
we obviously knew Weiner is a euphemism. We thought it can't be that offensive because

