00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:40,800
good at what they do. Other than that, we tend to minimize hierarchy. We do have some structure,

184
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:46,480
we have some teams and we have team leaders. But for us, leadership really is about enabling people

